1
00:00:00,816 --> 00:00:04,406
(Sheldon:)And she would entertain me with stories
about growing up in Oklahoma.

2
00:00:04,570 --> 00:00:05,650
lnteresting woman.

3
00:00:05,821 --> 00:00:09,991
(Sheldon:)You know, she once killed a prairie dog
with a gravy boat.

4
00:00:10,659 --> 00:00:12,829
(Howard:)That's nice.

5
00:00:19,543 --> 00:00:21,043
Whew. Heh.

6
00:00:22,880 --> 00:00:25,130
That's a lot of beIt buckles.

7
00:00:25,966 --> 00:00:28,676
Funny thing is I only have one beIt.

8
00:00:30,471 --> 00:00:32,101
(Howard:)Anyway, I'll let you get started.

9
00:00:32,264 --> 00:00:36,354
(Howard:)Oh, by the way, the little marks
that look like water spots...

10
00:00:36,518 --> 00:00:39,148
...l tend to stand too close
to the urinal, so...

11
00:00:41,523 --> 00:00:45,023
(Howard:)What you're seeing there
is splash-back.

12
00:00:46,445 --> 00:00:48,695
You make sissy on your beIt buckles?

13
00:00:51,658 --> 00:00:54,788
(Sheldon:)Mee-Maw's forks never had that.

14
00:00:54,953 --> 00:00:58,833
(Howard:)Here is a black light to check them.
For your own peace of mind...

15
00:00:58,999 --> 00:01:11,029
...you might not wanna shine that
around the rest of the room.

